  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 350 degrees F.",
    "Combine salmon, bread crumbs, mayonnaise, onion, salt, and pepper in a large bowl, mixing well.",
    "Place puff pastry sheet on a lightly floured surface and spoon salmon mixture down the middle section. Fold the right side over salmon; then fold the left side, overlapping puff pastry. Seal edges.",
    "Place loaf, seam side down, on an ungreased 13 x 9 inch baking dish. Brush with eggs.",
    "Bake for 45 min or until golden brown.",
    "Before serving, pour some of the cucumber dill sauce over the top of the loaf with the remaining sauce served on the side.",
    "Cucumber dill sauce: Combine cucumber, mayonnaise, onion and dill. Gradually add enough water to desired consistency; cover and chill. Serve in a small dish or in a fresh lemon basket."
